OL,3,ABritish trekker's body found in
OL,4,Anorthern Pakistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a British trekker has been
OL,7,Ffound in northern Pakistan, local
OL,8,Fofficials have said.
OL,10,FAlexander Harris, who was originally
OL,11,Ffrom Birmingham, went missing on
OL,12,FSaturday as he was descending from the
OL,13,Fsummit of Musa Ka Musala, a mountain of
OL,14,Fjust over 4,000m (13,000ft), in the
OL,15,FKhyber Pakhtunkhwa province.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
