OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABritish trekker's body found in
OL,4,Anorthern Pakistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FKhalid Iqbal, the area's deputy
OL,7,Fcommissioner, said police and
OL,8,Fvolunteers had been involved in a
OL,9,Fsearch for 30-year-old Harris and his
OL,10,Fbody was found on a path in a forest,
OL,11,Fadding "most probably he slipped and
OL,12,Ffell".
OL,14,FHe said it was suspected Harris, who
OL,15,Fhad been living in Pakistan's capital
OL,16,FIslamabad where he worked for global
OL,17,Fadvisory company Adam Smith
OL,18,FInternational, had slipped and fallen.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
